  "notes": "Centered 2nd-order FD on a non-uniform vertical grid with per-cell dz[k] is theoretically O(dz_k^2) when u[k-1/2] and u[k+1/2] are the face-staggered values (analogous to the uniform case with h replaced by dz[k]). The geometrically-stretched grid (ratio 1.5) exercises per-cell dz bindings that vary by ~1.5x across adjacent cells; we require observed min order >= 1.9 across the n=16->32->64->128 sequence to tolerate minor pre-asymptotic drift. Activation pending the 1d_vertical_column canonical-pipeline runner (ESD/dsc-yz0m)."
